WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.791
<b><font color='#000000'>As you can see, the metadata in the input form is grouped into six different categories. </font></b>

2
00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:10.166
<b><font color='#000000'>The metadata in the first category "Required" is mandatory, </font></b>

3
00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:14.916
<b><font color='#000000'>if this information is not provided, it will not be possible to archive your data. </font></b>

4
00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:18.000
<b><font color='#000000'>In order to enter your metadata, click on the first category</font></b>

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.666
<b><font color='#000000'>and you can see how the form expands. </font></b>

6
00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:29.500
<b><font color='#000000'>These six metadata fields in the "Required" category are mandatory and must be filled in. </font></b>

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.333
<b><font color='#000000'>To get started, go to the first section for identifiers. </font></b>

8
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:38.208
<b><font color='#000000'>Use the drop-down menu to select the identifier you want to assign to your data.</font></b>

9
00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:43.250
<b><font color='#000000'>For example, if your data is already published, this could be a DOI, </font></b>

10
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.875
<b><font color='#000000'> a Digital Object Identifier. </font></b>

11
00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:50.375
<b><font color='#000000'>When the type of identifier is selected, you will see that another field appears.</font></b>

12
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:53.333
<b><font color='#000000'>Here you can now enter the DOI itself.</font></b>

13
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:59.416
<b><font color='#000000'>Please note that some of the identifiers, such as a DOI, may have a specific structure.</font></b>

14
00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.041
<b><font color='#000000'>If your entry does not have the correct form,</font></b>

15
00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:07.333
<b><font color='#000000'>the red colouring will indicate that there is an error, so that you can check your entry.</font></b>

16
00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.791
<b><font color='#000000'>In general, if you are not sure what each of the fields mean,</font></b>

17
00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:15.458
<b><font color='#000000'>you can find further information for every field by using the information symbol.</font></b>

18
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.333
<b><font color='#000000'>To hide the additional information, just click on the symbol again. </font></b>

19
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:23.083
<b><font color='#000000'>If you would like to enter an additional identifier for your data - </font></b>

20
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:28.375
<b><font color='#000000'> for example a project-specific identifier, just use the "Add Identifier" button. </font></b>

21
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:32.666
<b><font color='#000000'>As you can see, a new input field has been added. </font></b>

22
00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:37.333
<b><font color='#000000'>If you change your mind and decide you don´t need this additional identifier </font></b>

23
00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:40.000
<b><font color='#000000'> you can simply delete it from the form. </font></b>

24
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.125
<b><font color='#000000'>Just use the recycle bin symbol to the left of the input field.</font></b>

25
00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:49.416
<b><font color='#000000'>Please note that at least one identifier must be present, as this is a mandatory field. </font></b>

26
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:53.458
<b><font color='#000000'>All other metadata in this form, both required and optional, </font></b>

27
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:56.458
<b><font color='#000000'> can be entered in the same way as just shown. </font></b>

28
00:01:56.458 --> 00:02:00.500
<b><font color='#000000'>Once you've finished entering your metadata, don't forget to save your input </font></b>

29
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.708
<b><font color='#000000'>using the “Save” button in the bottom right-hand corner. </font></b>

30
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:07.708
<b><font color='#000000'>If you close the form without saving, all your entries will be lost.</font></b>

